<title>USA: Lyondell names William Butler chairman.</title>
<headline>Lyondell names William Butler chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lyondell Petrochemical Co said Monday it named William Butler chairman, following the previously announced retirement of Bob Gower.</p>
<p>Butler is chancellor of Baylor College of Medicine in Houston, a post he will continue to hold, Lyondell said.</p>
<p>As non-executive board chairman, Lyondell said he will manage board activities and coordinate communication among board members and with the company's president and chief executive.</p>
</text>
